Z||000007||My7Fieros||10-01-2001||11:10 PM||||Well the first one I got I used. I'll use the upgrade cds (4.0- 5.0, 5.0-6.0, ect.). All the other ones I just store somewhere (for some unknown reason). <BR>For some reason I seem to take it personally when people bash AOL (not like I own the company or anything). With the exception of cable modem ISP's, Ive tried most all the other ISP's and CANT stand them. AOL is all I use. Ive defended AOL in the past and dont feel like doing it again. But, I know what you mean about always getting the disk...but who cares? They're FREE. Throw them away if you dont use them.<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||1
