Z||000018||Ken Wittlief||10-03-2001||10:27 AM||||well to give you an idea of how violently they shatter when they break - I havent done the math but I thing the flying pieces might be breaking the sound barrier.<P>  one shattered on me while I was spinning it up - it sounded like a shotgun went off.<P> and the pieces that go flying are sharp little shards of plastic.<P> BTW - its does work at 5,000 rpm or less - it wont stay stuck as long, and you dont get the same THUMP when it jumps from the dremil tool to the ceiling.<P> I didnt try it again for 3 days - adreneline does funny stuff to you.||||reg||1
